On an iPhone, add CarmaCars to the Home Screen first (Safari, **Share**, **Add to Home Screen**). Use your phone''s own Focus or Do Not Disturb for quiet hours.',
  '<p class="gd-p">Every function has the calendar and Find a renter. Use them to answer questions fast.</p><section class="gd-task" id="shared-tools-the-calendar" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">The calendar</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Every car with its photo, its bookings, requests and blocks. The red line is now. Tap a bar for its details; on a phone it opens on the agenda, by day.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Use the arrows, Today and the range to move around, or search by plate, booking or name.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Fleet and customer service can remove a cleaning block from its side panel (<b class="gd-ui">Remove the block</b>) when a car is ready sooner.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/va/calendar</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1230/800"><img src="/guides/img/va-cs-09-calendar-desktop-541a6da5.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1230" height="800"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:60.2%;top:33.8%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:28.5%;top:17.5%" aria-hidden="true">2</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="shared-tools-find-a-car" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Find a car</h2><p class="gd-p"><b class="gd-ui">Bookings</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Find a car</b> (Finance and Fleet: <b class="gd-ui">Rentals</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Find a car</b>). A renter quotes the car code on the car&#39;s page (like CC-7F3A).</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Type the car code, a plate, a VIN or the name. Each car shows its code, plate, status and its page on the site.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">In Add a rental, type the car code or plate in the box above Car to choose it.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="shared-tools-find-a-renter" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Find a renter</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Search by name, email, phone or booking number.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Opening a renter&#39;s private details asks for a reason (<b class="gd-ui">Open with a reason</b>). It is kept in the access log.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/va/renters</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1230/240"><img src="/guides/img/va-cs-07-renters-desktop-99cfd0ef.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1230" height="240"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:68.3%;top:34.6%" aria-hidden="true">1</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="shared-tools-email-the-renter" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Email the renter</h2><p class="gd-p">Customer service, Sales, Fleet and Finance can all write to the renter from a booking: press <b class="gd-ui">Email the renter</b>, or open the <b class="gd-ui">Messages</b> tab.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Write a <b class="gd-ui">Subject</b> and a <b class="gd-ui">Message</b>, or pick a <b class="gd-ui">Quick reply</b> to start from.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Email the renter</b>. It goes from CarmaCars and the renter can answer in their account; the answer opens a task for customer service.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">On a booking an insurer pays you can choose Blind Spot Car Rental (insurance) as the sender, and <b class="gd-ui">Email the adjuster</b> writes to the adjuster on the booking.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">The tab lists the messages both ways and every email of the booking with its state. Each email counts against the daily email limit, shown under the form.</p><h3 class="gd-h3">Find a booking</h3><p class="gd-p"><b class="gd-ui">Rentals</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Bookings</b> lists <b class="gd-ui">My bookings</b> (yours, with your commission) and finds any booking: type at least 3 characters of the booking number (CC-1042, 1042), the renter&#39;s or a driver&#39;s name, an email, a phone number, a plate or a car code, then press Enter. Every search is logged, as Find a renter.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="shared-tools-phone-alerts" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Phone alerts</h2><p class="gd-p">Get an alert on your phone or computer for new requests, replies to answer and urgent problems, even with the portal closed.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b> (top of the menu). Under <b class="gd-ui">Phone alerts</b>, press <b class="gd-ui">Turn on alerts</b> and allow notifications. The first page of the portal also offers it once.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Under <b class="gd-ui">What to alert me about</b>: new requests, booking changes and messages are on for staff; payments are off until you tick them.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Send a test alert</b> checks the device. <b class="gd-ui">Remove</b> takes an old phone off.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">On an iPhone, add CarmaCars to the Home Screen first (Safari, <b class="gd-ui">Share</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Add to Home Screen</b>). Use your phone&#39;s own Focus or Do Not Disturb for quiet hours.</p></section>');
